  "system": {
    "identifier": "disciplined-maneuvers",
    "description": "<p>Once per turn, when you take the Trip, Grapple, Shove, Disarm, Maintain Focus, Feint, Demoralize or Read the Enemy Skill based actions on your turn, you gain 1 Discipline. This increases to 2 Discipline at 11th level and 3 Discipline at 20th level. If you gained Discipline as a result of the Discipline class feature by casting a Bukijutsu with the Chain keyword already this turn, you cannot gain Discipline by taking one of the aforementioned Skill-based actions in the same turn. You cannot use Disciplined Strikes in the same turn you use this Kata.</p>",
